# A new world builds with the starting pieces: the drawer lists only what is unlocked, ending
# each unfinished tab with a lock tile that leads to the wishes.
click ui:build
wait 12
click ui:tab:homes
wait 12
expect widget tile:cottage yes
expect widget tile:barn no
expect widget tile:locked yes
move ui:tile:locked
wait 45
shot shots/drawer_locked.png
click ui:tile:locked
wait 12
expect journal open
key escape
key escape
set unlock all
click ui:build
wait 12
click ui:tab:homes
wait 12
expect widget tile:barn yes
expect widget tile:locked no
quit
